## For AI Agent — TDD Workflow

When implementing a new feature:

```
1. CREATE test file first (feature.test.ts)
2. WRITE failing tests for the expected behavior
3. RUN tests → verify they FAIL (red)
4. IMPLEMENT the minimum code to pass
5. RUN tests → verify they PASS (green)
6. REFACTOR if needed, keep tests green
7. ADD edge case tests
8. RUN full suite: npm run check
```

**Never write code without a test. Never commit code with failing tests.**
